WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
From Downward-Facing Dog, step one foot forward between the hands.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Rise up, stacking the front knee over the ankle, back heel lifted.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Engage the back leg, reaching energetically through the lifted heel.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Inhale the arms overhead, reaching long through the fingertips.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Hold, breathing steadily, then step back and switch sides.
